{"source":"## Semantics: U1 (rs#297) — `.` matches whole codepoints; min/max are\n## codepoint counts; no span may split a character.\ngrammar ConformanceUnicodeAny version \"1.0.0\" {\n  ## A bounded run of any codepoints.\n  run = 2*4 ANY\n\n  entry main: run\n\n  test main {\n    accept \"日本語\"\n    accept \"ab\"\n    accept \"日本語x\"\n    reject \"日\"\n    reject \"日本語x!\"\n    shape \"日本語x\" \"日本語x\"\n  }\n}\n","tokens":[{"type":"doc","value":"## Semantics: U1 (rs#297) — `.` matches whole codepoints; min/max are","offset":0},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":69},{"type":"doc","value":"## codepoint counts; no span may split a character.","offset":70},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":121},{"type":"ident","value":"grammar","offset":122},{"type":"ident","value":"ConformanceUnicodeAny","offset":130},{"type":"ident","value":"version","offset":152},{"type":"str","value":"\"1.0.0\"","offset":160},{"type":"punct","value":"{","offset":168},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":169},{"type":"doc","value":"## A bounded run of any codepoints.","offset":172},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":207},{"type":"ident","value":"run","offset":210},{"type":"punct","value":"=","offset":214},{"type":"num","value":"2","offset":216},{"type":"punct","value":"*","offset":217},{"type":"num","value":"4","offset":218},{"type":"ident","value":"ANY","offset":220},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":223},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":224},{"type":"ident","value":"entry","offset":227},{"type":"ident","value":"main","offset":233},{"type":"punct","value":":","offset":237},{"type":"ident","value":"run","offset":239},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":242},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":243},{"type":"ident","value":"test","offset":246},{"type":"ident","value":"main","offset":251},{"type":"punct","value":"{","offset":256},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":257},{"type":"ident","value":"accept","offset":262},{"type":"str","value":"\"日本語\"","offset":2